# system_test.tcyr — the system passes and the library entry points around
# detection (2.5.5): the runtime environment (k8s GPU count, cloud DMI),
# storage classification over a fixture /sys/block, the TTL cache under
# threads, the threaded entry point's backend split and its first getenv, and
# the data directory a library build resolves. Linux only: the fixtures live
# under /tmp, and two tests run this binary again as a child (/proc/self/exe).

